# ── Secrets — NEVER commit real credentials. Only *.example placeholders ship. ──
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
*_rsa
*_ed25519
id_*
credentials*
secrets*
*.secret

# ── Machine: ephemeral run-store + per-project workspaces (data, not code) ──
research_agent_teams/runs/
research_agent_teams/projects/

